From: 77450danik <dnsystems@email.ua>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] explorer: The buttons of Windows 11, in the middle, and a picture for Start.

The page Buttons of startui.dll chooses the buttons of Windows 10 or 11
(rounded, with a pill, in a row of 48), left or centre, and a
picture for the Start button as Classic Shell has it. A right click on a
button shows the menu of Windows 10 and 11, which needs nothing of the
window; with Shift, the window's own.
---
